v 3
d 'wxsum': A command for processing temperature and precipitation data
d
d wxsum computes seasonal (calendar) or unit-specific window statistics from
d daily weather data: distributions, totals, rainy and heat days, dry and heat
d spells, growing and killing degree days, bins, and deviations and z-scores
d relative to a rolling or fixed reference period. wxprep converts long daily
d data, or wide data with other variable names, to the layout wxsum needs.
d
d Version: wxsum 7.0.0, wxprep 1.0.0
d Distribution-Date: 20261026
d
d Author: Jeffrey D. Michler
d Support: jdmichler@arizona.edu
d
f wxsum.ado
f wxsum.sthlp
f wxprep.ado
f wxprep.sthlp
f wxsum_rain.dta
f wxsum_temp.dta
f examples/hh_panel.dta
